      "sourceTextSha256": "e7674a40d5daca6a414bdeba246bf262ec8d938442066963fc4694fe78641105",
      "text": "Over 5 days, you will explore Oaxaca's historic centre, see ancient Monte Albán and discover Mitla's stone mosaics. In artisan workshops, you will learn about alebrijes, black pottery and weaving, then admire the mineral cascades at Hierve el Agua. All 4 nights are spent in Oaxaca.",
